flowchart LR
    Q[Held quotes in arrival order] --> QA[Take quote whole when it fits]
    QA --> R[Residual demand is the supply]
    R --> S((Source))
    S -->|capacity allocatable seats cost 0| N1[Open ship node]
    S -->|capacity allocatable seats cost 0| N2[Open ship node]
    N1 -->|capacity supply cost arrival times n plus position| T((Sink))
    N2 -->|capacity supply cost arrival times n plus position| T
    T --> ST{Solver status usable}
    ST -->|OPTIMAL or FEASIBLE| OUT[Flow per ship read as seats]
    ST -->|other status| ZERO[Open ships get zero seats]
    OUT --> RES[Selected ships first then unselected in arrival order]
    ZERO --> RES
